{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：02:03 2026-10-23 HKT<br/>發佈時間：02:03 2026-10-23 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：02:03 2026-10-23 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f3e94fe44cad5b65e850c00f3bece934/2026-10/2026-10-22_18_38_19.png\"/><p>長沙灣蘇屋邨今日（22日）發生懷疑自殺事件。上午11時51分，一名男子報案，指發現其72歲姓盧母親在壽菊樓住所內懷疑自縊，已將她救下。</p><p>救援人員接報到場，女事主當時不省人事，隨即將她送往明愛醫院搶救，惟其後證實不治。</p><p>據悉，女事主生前有病在身，現場疑有遺書。事件原因仍待調查，確實死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T18:20:24.211524+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":233,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T18:03:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T02:58:34.553948+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T18:18:12.041792+00:00","content_hash":"5b34167b9423eec988950d65bc9d6f84b4359456543458d6127b8fdc3e19f18f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}